{
    "la": {
        "Vegeta": "Vegeta",
        "And so he left, desperate and stronger.": "Atque ita discessit, desperatus et fortior.",
        "KINGMOD_VEGETA_SKIN_DEFAULT": "Ordinarius",
        "KINGMOD_VEGETA_SKIN_BADMAN": "Badman",
        "Saiyan Blood": "Sanguis Saiyan",
        "Skills also require <color=#03bcff>Ki</color> to be used!\nPerform a <color=#FF5400>Main Transformation</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>C</color> (View Transformations Tab for more info).\n<color=#FF5400>Power down</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>X</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Fly</color> by holding <color=#03f4fc>Jump</color>.": "Artes quoque <color=#03bcff>Ki</color> ad usum requirunt!\nPerfice <color=#FF5400>Transformationem Principalem</color> premendo <color=#03f4fc>C</color> (Vide Tabulam Transformationum pro pluribus).\n<color=#FF5400>Remitte vim</color> premendo <color=#03f4fc>X</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Vola</color> tenendo <color=#03f4fc>Salire</color>.",
        "Melee Strike": "Ictus Comminus",
        "Deal <color=#E5C962>280% Damage</color> each strike!\nGain <color=#03bcff>9% Ki</color> Per Hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Auto-moves to targeted enemies.</color>": "Infer <color=#E5C962>280% Damni</color> singulis ictibus!\nAdipiscere <color=#03bcff>9% Ki</color> per ictum!\n<color=#03f4fc>Sponte ad hostes petitos movetur.</color>",
        "Continuous Energy Blast": "Iactus Energiae Continuus",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>10 Ki</color>\nConcentrate and rapidly fire Ki Blasts, Dealing <color=#E5C962>120% Damage</color> with each one!\n<color=#03f4fc>Holding this skill drains </color><color=#03bcff>18 Ki </color><color=#03f4fc>per second.</color>": "Constat <color=#03bcff>10 Ki</color>\nAnimum intende et celeriter iactus Ki emitte, inferens <color=#E5C962>120% Damni</color> singulis!\n<color=#03f4fc>Tenere hanc artem exhaurit </color><color=#03bcff>18 Ki </color><color=#03f4fc>per secundum.</color>",
        "Rising Sledgehammer": "Tudes Ascendens",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>30 Ki</color>\nStrike and launch enemies upwards, dealing <color=#E5C962>400% Damage</color>!\nHolding the button follows-up with an additional downward strike, knocking-down enemies and dealing <color=#E5C962>1100% Damage</color>!\n": "Constat <color=#03bcff>30 Ki</color>\nFer et hostes sursum iace, inferens <color=#E5C962>400% Damni</color>!\nTenere clavem addit ictum deorsum, hostes prosternens et inferens <color=#E5C962>1100% Damni</color>!\n",
        "Empowered Ki Charge": "Impletio Ki Aucta",
        "Hold and Regenerate <color=#03bcff>30% Ki</color> Per Second!": "Tene et regenera <color=#03bcff>30% Ki</color> per secundum!",
        "Flip": "Saltus Volubilis",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>20 Ki</color>\nPerform a quick flip in a direction.\n<color=#03f4fc>Gain Invulnerability whilst skill is active</color>": "Constat <color=#03bcff>20 Ki</color>\nPerfice saltum celerem in partem.\n<color=#03f4fc>Adipiscere invulnerabilitatem dum ars activa est</color>",
        "Galick Gun": "Galick Gun",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>40 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a Galick Gun, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1500% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>800% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>": "Constat <color=#03bcff>40 Ki</color>\nImple et emitte Galick Gun, inferens <color=#E5C962>1500% Damni</color> per secundum dum iactus activus est! \nConsume Ki additicium et auge damnum per <color=#E5C962>800% Damni</color> per secundum impletionis!\n<color=#03f4fc>Consumptio Ki paulatim crescit quo diutius imples!</color>",
        "Galaxy Breaker": "Ruptor Galaxiae",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>100 Ki</color>\nGenerate immense power to fire an energy wave upwards, dealing <color=#E5C962>3600% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!\nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1600% Damage</color> and size per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>": "Constat <color=#03bcff>100 Ki</color>\nGenera vim immensam ad undam energiae sursum emittendam, inferens <color=#E5C962>3600% Damni</color> per secundum dum iactus activus est!\nConsume Ki additicium et auge damnum per <color=#E5C962>1600% Damni</color> ac magnitudinem per secundum impletionis!\n<color=#03f4fc>Consumptio Ki paulatim crescit quo diutius imples!</color>",
        "Big Bang Attack": "Big Bang Attack",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>60 Ki</color>\nUnleash an explosive ball of energy! \nExplodes on hit, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1600% Damage</color>!\n": "Constat <color=#03bcff>60 Ki</color>\nEmitte globum energiae displodentem! \nDisplodit in ictu, inferens <color=#E5C962>1600% Damni</color>!\n",
        "Final Flash": "Final Flash",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>120 Ki</color>\nCharge up and unleash a devastating Final Flash, Dealing <color=#E5C962>3000% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!": "Constat <color=#03bcff>120 Ki</color>\nImple et emitte vastantem Final Flash, inferens <color=#E5C962>3000% Damni</color> per secundum dum iactus activus est!",
        "Final Explosion": "Final Explosion",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>200 Ki</color>\nRelease a massively expanding explosion, Dealing <color=#E5C962>2500% Damage</color> and\ndraining <color=#03bcff>40% of Max Ki</color> per second!\n<color=#FF0000>Once Ki reaches 0, Health is drained instead, Can be fatal...</color>": "Constat <color=#03bcff>200 Ki</color>\nDimitte deflagrationem late patentem, inferens <color=#E5C962>2500% Damni</color> et\nexhauriens <color=#03bcff>40% Ki Maximi</color> per secundum!\n<color=#FF0000>Cum Ki ad 0 pervenit, Salus pro eo exhauritur. Mortiferum esse potest...</color>",
        "Prominence Flash": "Prominence Flash",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>200 Ki</color>\nCharge up and unleash a devastating God-level Prominence Flash, Dealing <color=#E5C962>4000% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!": "Constat <color=#03bcff>200 Ki</color>\nImple et emitte vastantem Prominence Flash divini gradus, inferens <color=#E5C962>4000% Damni</color> per secundum dum iactus activus est!",
        "Niagra Pummel": "Verberatio Niagara",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>300 Ki</color>\nPower up and unleash a insanely fast barrage of strikes! \nDealing <color=#E5C962>222% Damage</color> for each one!\nFinishing it off with a powerful blow, Dealing <color=#E5C962>666% Damage</color>!": "Constat <color=#03bcff>300 Ki</color>\nAuge vim et emitte immaniter celerem ictuum procellam! \nInferens <color=#E5C962>222% Damni</color> singulis!\nRem conficiens ictu valido, inferens <color=#E5C962>666% Damni</color>!",
        "Full Power Final Explosion": "Final Explosion Plenae Potestatis",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>400 Ki</color>\nRelease a massively expanding explosion,  Dealing <color=#E5C962>2700% Damage</color> and\ndraining <color=#03bcff>20% of Max Ki</color> per second!\n<color=#FF0000>Once Ki reaches 0, Health is drained instead, this version won't kill you...</color>": "Constat <color=#03bcff>400 Ki</color>\nDimitte deflagrationem late patentem, inferens <color=#E5C962>2700% Damni</color> et\nexhauriens <color=#03bcff>20% Ki Maximi</color> per secundum!\n<color=#FF0000>Cum Ki ad 0 pervenit, Salus pro eo exhauritur; haec forma te non occidet...</color>",
        "Final Shine Attack": "Final Shine Attack",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>80 Ki</color>\nUnleash a powerful Final Shine Attack, Dealing <color=#E5C962>3600% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!": "Constat <color=#03bcff>80 Ki</color>\nEmitte validum Final Shine Attack, inferens <color=#E5C962>3600% Damni</color> per secundum dum iactus activus est!",
        "Super Galick Gun": "Super Galick Gun",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>300 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a Super Galick Gun, Dealing <color=#E5C962>8000% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!": "Constat <color=#03bcff>300 Ki</color>\nImple et emitte Super Galick Gun, inferens <color=#E5C962>8000% Damni</color> per secundum dum iactus activus est!",
